Once you have Docker Desktop opened, we will run our first real DevOps commands from PowerShell:

Verify connection:
--> docker ps
Build your first container image:
--> docker build -t your-dockerhub-username/product-catalog:v1 -f src/product-catalog/Dockerfile src/product-catalog/
Run your container:
--> docker run -d -p 8088:8088 --name my-product-catalog your-dockerhub-username/product-catalog:v1
Push it to Docker Hub:
--> docker push your-dockerhub-username/product-catalog:v1



